.TH voltkit-daemon 1  "Voltkit 0.1.2" "Voltkit Manual"
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
voltkit\-daemon \- Run the background service that listens for global shortcuts
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBvoltkit daemon\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run the background service that listens for global shortcuts
.PP
Without a subcommand, runs the service in the foreground until interrupted. It owns io.github.arios4k.Voltkit.Daemon on the session bus, so only one instance runs, and binds the configured hotkeys through the XDG GlobalShortcuts portal when the desktop provides it.
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBvoltkit daemon status\fR
Show whether the daemon is running and how shortcuts are bound
.TP
\fBvoltkit daemon stop\fR
Stop the running daemon
.TP
\fBvoltkit daemon enable\-autostart\fR
Start the daemon automatically at login
.TP
\fBvoltkit daemon disable\-autostart\fR
Stop starting the daemon at login
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH "SHORTCUT BACKENDS"
.TP
\fBportal\fR
The GlobalShortcuts portal (GNOME 48+, KDE Plasma 5.27+, Hyprland). The desktop asks once for approval.
.TP
\fBgnome\-keybindings\fR
Custom shortcuts added by voltkit shortcuts install.
.TP
\fBnone\fR
Bind voltkit trigger ACTION in the desktop or compositor settings.
.SH "D-BUS INTERFACE"
.PP
Bus name io.github.arios4k.Voltkit.Daemon, object /io/github/arios4k/Voltkit/Daemon, interface io.github.arios4k.Voltkit.Daemon1:
.TP
\fBTrigger(s action)\fR
Start "ocr", "color" or "snippets" and return immediately. Ignored while another one is open.
.TP
\fBStatus() → (sss)\fR
The version, the shortcut backend, and whether typed triggers are on, off or unavailable.
.TP
\fBQuit()\fR
Stop the daemon.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Check whether it is running:
.RS 4
.nf
\fBvoltkit daemon status\fR
.fi
.RE
.PP
Trigger OCR from another program:
.RS 4
.nf
\fBbusctl \-\-user call io.github.arios4k.Voltkit.Daemon /io/github/arios4k/Voltkit/Daemon io.github.arios4k.Voltkit.Daemon1 Trigger s ocr\fR
.fi
.RE
.SH FILES
.TP
\fB~/.config/voltkit/config.toml\fR
Configuration: hotkeys, OCR language, compression quality and snippets. Every key is optional.
.TP
\fB~/.local/share/voltkit/colors.txt\fR
Color history, newest first, shared by pick\-color, the daemon and the control center.
.TP
\fB~/.config/autostart/io.github.arios4k.Voltkit.Daemon.desktop\fR
Created by voltkit daemon enable\-autostart.
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
